    <briefdescription>
<para>Input event emitted when face and eye gaze tracking is actively locked. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides localized 2D gaze coordinates via <ref refid="classgodot_1_1_input_event_gaze_1a7529fdee3583d83f7882fc4df813ac87" kindref="member">get_eye_gaze()</ref> and <ref refid="classgodot_1_1_input_event_gaze_1a4dafd0841bc03e61d806e797aed7877d" kindref="member">get_nose_gaze()</ref>, as well as 3D head pose and eye gaze ray properties in Godot camera space. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
